{"articleNo":"225235","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=225235&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 2019 독서인증제 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.05.30","hit":"8927","attachments":[{"name":"독서인증제 안내(2019_학생용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=225235&attachNo=80059"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"xed\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;2019년도 독서인증제 운영을 다음과 같이 안내합니다. </p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;- 신청기간 : 1학기 3. !. ~&nbsp;&nbsp;7.20. (평가 7.31.까지)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2학기 9.1. ~ 2010. 1. 20. (평가 1.31.까지)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">-&nbsp; 참여자 혜택</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . kit 인재 인증 독서인증 점수 반영(5권 10점)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . 학기별 우수참여자 시상 (최우수자 총장상 수여, 우수자 부상 수여)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">- 참여방법</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . 독서인증제선정도서 (도서관 3층 테마존)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .&nbsp;원스톱서비스에 독후감&nbsp;입력 (독서인증 신청)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; . 도서별 지도교수 평가&nbsp; - 인증확인</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">-&nbsp;담당자 : 054-478-7167 (도서관 열람팀)</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">* 좋은 책을 읽고&nbsp;혜택도 많이&nbsp;받을 수 있는&nbsp;\"독서인증제\",</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 0.8;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 많이 참여하세요!!!</p></div><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
